    "Double Cross uses actual positive shared mana payment endpoints or an original explicit consumption record reaching zero. Ordinary hand, hero power, trade/forge/prepare and starship payments share pay_quote. Refunds or other later balance changes do not rewrite the original endpoints. Existing SecretHandSpace enforces the official 25.4 full-hand restriction; partial space still delegates both draws and overflow.",
    "Kidnap follows the original completed opponent hand-minion board residence through same-residence transforms/control changes. Genuine departure, non-entry and Dormant eligibility remain existing local gates; full friendly board keeps the Secret.",
    "One actual original minion is silently stored, and the real first Sack is delivered atomically using the existing attributed quantity/entry handler before aura/death checkpoints. Typed native Deathrattle memory is installed before entry reactions; extra quantity/current copies share the same original stored reference. No alternate summon or death executor is created.",
    "Sack Deathrattle returns that same physical entity once through ordinary SetAsideCardReference/MoveCard hand delivery and overflow. The current actual Deathrattle controller opponent receives it. Silence/transform/bounce clear normal carrier memory; base copies and unbound Sacks have no captive. Exact copied/stolen Sack and alive-linked lasting effects are local lifecycle policies, not current CN claims.",
    "Original raw Sack Attack is absent and remains null in the source; execution uses zero, explicitly stated by the root 0/4 wording. REV_828e is complete enchantment evidence, not an executable hand card or a generated replacement body."
